{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Gather Your Party</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716090/extras/88ba0486cbf59b44394ea63138356667.poster.avif?t=1757922044\" width=1170 height=660 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716090/extras/88ba0486cbf59b44394ea63138356667.webm?t=1757922044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a world where (almost) any enemy you face can become an ally! Choose from five playable heroes, and over 40 recruitable monsters; each with their own strengths, weaknesses, and equipment options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ruins of the Capital are an unforgiving place, and you will need to choose your allies and equipment wisely to have any chance of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Strategic Combat</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716090/extras/4d485642cab97cdd1d213242c7a38de6.poster.avif?t=1757922044\" width=1170 height=660 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716090/extras/4d485642cab97cdd1d213242c7a38de6.webm?t=1757922044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716090/extras/4d485642cab97cdd1d213242c7a38de6.mp4?t=1757922044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies in Drowning Ashes are dangerous, and each encounter can pose a deadly threat to the unprepared.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn each enemy's weaknesses, and build your perfect strategy to conquer impossible odds against deadly bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Souls-Inspired</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716090/extras/1284d60caa37ea0bc1a1d395aae8e0e6.poster.avif?t=1757922044\" width=1170 height=660 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716090/extras/1284d60caa37ea0bc1a1d395aae8e0e6.webm?t=1757922044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716090/extras/1284d60caa37ea0bc1a1d395aae8e0e6.mp4?t=1757922044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a cursed and dying world, rest at Wellsprings to restore your healing flasks, and temper the Ashes of your foes into mighty weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drowning Ashes is a turn-based monster collector at is core, but fans of the souls-like genre will find plenty of familiar tropes amidst the ruins of the Capital.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3716090?t=1757922044","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3716090?t=1757922044","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716090/0b5c9000d8b11b4894c92bf52c6bb3a97dddabe1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757922044","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716090/0b5c9000d8b11b4894c92bf52c6bb3a97dddabe1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757922044","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Some of the dialogue and lore entries allude to dark themes such as torture, death and suffering, though not in any great detail."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Gather Your Party</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716090/extras/88ba0486cbf59b44394ea63138356667.poster.avif?t=1757922044\" width=1170 height=660 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716090/extras/88ba0486cbf59b44394ea63138356667.webm?t=1757922044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a world where (almost) any enemy you face can become an ally! Choose from five playable heroes, and over 40 recruitable monsters; each with their own strengths, weaknesses, and equipment options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ruins of the Capital are an unforgiving place, and you will need to choose your allies and equipment wisely to have any chance of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Strategic Combat</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716090/extras/4d485642cab97cdd1d213242c7a38de6.poster.avif?t=1757922044\" width=1170 height=660 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716090/extras/4d485642cab97cdd1d213242c7a38de6.webm?t=1757922044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716090/extras/4d485642cab97cdd1d213242c7a38de6.mp4?t=1757922044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies in Drowning Ashes are dangerous, and each encounter can pose a deadly threat to the unprepared.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn each enemy's weaknesses, and build your perfect strategy to conquer impossible odds against deadly bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Souls-Inspired</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716090/extras/1284d60caa37ea0bc1a1d395aae8e0e6.poster.avif?t=1757922044\" width=1170 height=660 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716090/extras/1284d60caa37ea0bc1a1d395aae8e0e6.webm?t=1757922044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716090/extras/1284d60caa37ea0bc1a1d395aae8e0e6.mp4?t=1757922044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a cursed and dying world, rest at Wellsprings to restore your healing flasks, and temper the Ashes of your foes into mighty weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drowning Ashes is a turn-based monster collector at is core, but fans of the souls-like genre will find plenty of familiar tropes amidst the ruins of the Capital.</p>","developers":["Elston Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716090/32a6bcd9a61a0575d9736c4d1197fac09a23414f/header.jpg?t=1757922044","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257191782,"mp4":{"480":"http://video